source: crates/pouch-cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: out
---
Only the skills this project needs.

Usage: pouch [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  source      Manage skill sources
  search      Search skills across sources
  show        Show one skill: metadata, supporting files, absolute path
  bundle      Manage skill bundles
  add         Add skills to this project's selection and apply them
  rm          Remove skills from this project's selection and apply the change
  use         Use a bundle in this project (with --replace or --add) and apply it
  deactivate  Remove every skill pouch placed for the target and clear its selection
  resume      Finish an interrupted apply
  rollback    Undo an interrupted apply, or restore the previous applied state
  status      Show the six-state table of this project's target
  reconcile   Report where the destination diverges from the selection
  doctor      Check symlinks, the destination, sources, the receipt, and the journal
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json            Print one JSON object on stdout
      --no-cache        Neither read nor write the catalog cache
  -v, --verbose...      More log output on stderr (repeatable)
  -q, --quiet           Less output: errors only in logs, no notes
      --project <PATH>  Use this directory as the project root (no search for `.git`)
      --target <ID>     The target to change: `claude-code` or `agents-neutral`
      --yes             Apply without a prompt (the plan is still printed)
  -h, --help            Print help
  -V, --version         Print version
